\f0\fs22\cf1\b\fs28 4. AI Drift Prediction Mathematical Engine\par
\cf0\b0\fs22 The discrete-time trajectory for particle i over hourly time steps dt = 3600s up to T = 72 hours is governed by:\par
\b x(t + dt) = x(t) + [ u_current + (alpha * u_wind) + (beta * u_wave) + eta ] * dt\b0\par
Where:\par
- \b u_current\b0 : Ocean surface current vector (u, v) in m/s from Open-Meteo Marine API.\par
- \b alpha (Windage Factor)\b0 : Buoys/Floats = 0.040, Submerged Gillnets = 0.012, Sunken Trawl Nets = 0.003.\par
- \b beta * u_wave (Stokes Wave Drift)\b0 : Momentum derived from wave height (Hs), wave direction, and peak period.\par
- \b eta (Turbulent Diffusion)\b0 : Stochastic Brownian diffusion: Normal(0, sqrt(2 * Kh * dt)) where Kh = 1.0 m2/s.\par
\par
\cf1\b\fs28 5. Composite Spatial Risk Scoring Model\par
\cf0\b0\fs22\b Risk Score = (Particle Density * 0.45) + (Ecological Sensitivity * 0.30) + (Fishing Activity * 0.15) + (Navigation Route * 0.10)\b0\par
- \cf4\b Critical (76-100)\cf0\b0 : Adyar Estuary mouth (13.00N, 80.27E) & Olive Ridley turtle breeding strip. Action: Immediate Recovery Alert.\par
- \cf5\b High (51-75)\cf0\b0 : Kasimedu mechanized trawl lanes & Ennore navigation approaches. Action: Recommend Patrol Mission.\par
- \b Medium (26-50)\b0 : Kovalam-Muttukadu coastal waters & mid-shelf artisanal zones. Action: Add to Watchlist.\par
- \cf6\b Low (0-25)\cf0\b0 : Deep offshore pelagic waters (>30 nm). Action: Passive Monitoring.\par
\par
\cf1\b\fs28 6. Circular Economy & Carbon Impact Metrics\par
\cf0\b0\fs22\b CO2e Avoided (kg) = Recovered Net Weight (kg) * Material Emission Factor\b0\par
- Nylon 6 (PA6): 6.5 kg CO2e / kg\par
- High-Density Polyethylene (HDPE): 2.1 kg CO2e / kg\par
- Polypropylene (PP) Ropes: 1.9 kg CO2e / kg\par
\b Protected Marine Animals = Recovered Net Weight (kg) * 0.12\b0\par
